The Great Britain team has been selected for the European Championships.

The team includes:
Max Whitlock, who is the world all-around champion and the Olympic team-mates champion;
Kristian Thomas, Sam Oldham, and Daniel Purvis;
Courtney Tulloch.

The team includes:
Louis Smith, who won two Olympic medals at London 2012, and who won pommel horse silver and team bronze at the London Games.

